1
00:00:01,181 --> 00:00:09,221
The Princess Sapphire

2
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:50,160
♪ Atashi no miru yume himitsu nano ♪
The dreams I see are my secret

3
00:00:51,250 --> 00:00:57,089
♪ Dare ni mo iwanai himitsu nano ♪
I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret

4
00:00:58,541 --> 00:01:02,461
♪ Akai manto hira hira ♪
A red cape fluttering

5
00:01:02,462 --> 00:01:04,981
♪ Uma o tobasu oujo ♪
Galloping on a horse—the princess

6
00:01:04,981 --> 00:01:06,901
♪ Sore ga atashi ♪
That’s me!

7
00:01:07,621 --> 00:01:10,901
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

8
00:01:10,905 --> 00:01:13,424
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

9
00:01:14,541 --> 00:01:18,021
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

10
00:01:18,140 --> 00:01:20,741
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

11
00:01:21,500 --> 00:01:25,220
♪ Ribon no kishi wa ♪
The Princess Knight,

12
00:01:25,220 --> 00:01:28,621
♪ Honto wa hontto wa ♪
Truly, truly,

13
00:01:28,622 --> 00:01:31,822
♪ Atashi nano sa ♪
It’s really me!

14
00:01:44,101 --> 00:01:50,141
Twenty-Fifth Episode
The King's Ghost

15
00:01:53,021 --> 00:01:55,410
Before telling you
the story of today,

16
00:01:55,461 --> 00:01:58,419
we will briefly remind you of
the previous episodes.

17
00:01:58,821 --> 00:02:01,415
The King disappeared
and it was decided that Sapphire

18
00:02:01,461 --> 00:02:03,417
...would be crowned King.

19
00:02:03,581 --> 00:02:05,299
But on the day of the ceremony,

20
00:02:05,341 --> 00:02:08,094
the Queen,
drugged by Geralamon and Neelon,

21
00:02:08,141 --> 00:02:10,735
revealed that Sapphire was a girl.

22
00:02:11,301 --> 00:02:16,500
So the Queen and Sapphire were
locked in the Coffin Tower.

23
00:02:16,741 --> 00:02:19,335
Geralamon began
to tyrannize the people.

24
00:02:19,621 --> 00:02:23,500
Learning this, Sapphire escaped through a
hole shown to her by a little mouse...

25
00:02:23,541 --> 00:02:27,329
...e, in the guise of the phantom
knight, freed the prisoners.

26
00:02:27,941 --> 00:02:30,739
Geralamon, suspecting
che il cavaliere fantasma...

27
00:02:30,781 --> 00:02:34,569
...could be Sapphire,
sent assassins to the tower.

28
00:02:34,741 --> 00:02:38,256
But Sapphire, warned by the little mouse,
managed to capture them...

29
00:02:38,301 --> 00:02:40,371
.and send them back to Geralamon

30
00:02:41,021 --> 00:02:43,012
After freeing some children,

31
00:02:43,061 --> 00:02:45,529
taken prisoner
to lure him into a trap,

32
00:02:45,581 --> 00:02:48,618
Sapphire, in the guise
of the phantom knight,

33
00:02:48,661 --> 00:02:52,654
manages to enter the castle
and steal the royal crown.

34
00:02:52,821 --> 00:02:57,133
Infuriated, Geralamon decides
to entrust Gama, the jailer,

35
00:02:57,181 --> 00:03:00,298
with the task of killing
the Queen and Sapphire.

36
00:03:00,341 --> 00:03:03,333
And now Gama prepares himself
for his sad task.

37
00:03:03,461 --> 00:03:05,019
Will he succeed?

38
00:03:17,781 --> 00:03:19,692
Help! Help!

39
00:04:29,421 --> 00:04:32,538
Thank you, dear little mice!
You saved my life!

40
00:04:32,741 --> 00:04:34,811
What's happening, Sapphire?

41
00:04:34,861 --> 00:04:37,011
Mother, Gama has fainted.

42
00:04:37,741 --> 00:04:40,016
My God! We must do something

43
00:04:47,101 --> 00:04:48,659
Here.

44
00:04:52,941 --> 00:04:55,091
But... what the hell did he do to you?

45
00:04:55,461 --> 00:04:57,691
- Nothing.
- Nothing?!

46
00:04:57,741 --> 00:05:00,653
What do you mean "nothing"?!
He wanted to make an attempt on your life!

47
00:05:01,501 --> 00:05:03,571
- He has a knife.
- What?

48
00:05:03,621 --> 00:05:06,499
Well, I'm sure he was
surprised by the rats...

49
00:05:06,541 --> 00:05:09,294
...and tried to chase them
away with the knife, but he fell.

50
00:05:09,341 --> 00:05:11,901
Let's do something,
otherwise he will die!

51
00:05:27,021 --> 00:05:29,455
Now he really seems
to be doing better.

52
00:05:29,501 --> 00:05:31,492
Let's boil a little
more water!

53
00:05:31,541 --> 00:05:33,213
I'll give you a hand!

54
00:05:48,461 --> 00:05:50,179
Shut up, idiot!

55
00:05:50,741 --> 00:05:53,813
Try again
and this time without an escort.

56
00:05:53,861 --> 00:05:56,739
You must succeed in
killing her absolutely!

57
00:05:59,101 --> 00:06:01,217
I will kill those who follow her.

58
00:06:06,901 --> 00:06:09,335
- Here you go, mother.
- Thank you, dear.

59
00:06:29,820 --> 00:06:31,732
There was a scoundrel!

60
00:06:32,860 --> 00:06:34,419
Yes...

61
00:06:40,180 --> 00:06:42,297
Gama, you saved me!

62
00:06:42,340 --> 00:06:44,491
Yes, I saved you.

63
00:06:45,740 --> 00:06:48,892
Gama, thank you! Thank you!
Thank you so much!

64
00:06:48,940 --> 00:06:50,897
Thank you so much, Gama!

65
00:06:51,620 --> 00:06:54,294
You're welcome! You're welcome!

66
00:07:27,380 --> 00:07:28,814
There!

67
00:07:30,900 --> 00:07:33,415
Listen, Gama,
mice are cute, aren't they?

68
00:07:33,660 --> 00:07:36,892
Yes, that's true!
They really are very cute!

69
00:07:43,340 --> 00:07:45,696
Thank you for your
delicious dinner, Gama!

70
00:07:50,900 --> 00:07:52,812
And now I must go!

71
00:07:56,100 --> 00:07:58,012
The Phantom Knight!

72
00:08:00,420 --> 00:08:03,219
I will no longer try
to tyrannize Sapphire!

73
00:08:03,260 --> 00:08:07,049
It's true, I have become a staunch
defender of Princess Sapphire

74
00:08:07,100 --> 00:08:09,057
..and also of the Queen!

75
00:08:13,420 --> 00:08:16,015
- Now I understand!
- That's right!

76
00:08:16,060 --> 00:08:19,497
The enemies of the Phantom Knight
are Geralamon and Neelon.

77
00:08:19,540 --> 00:08:23,454
To defeat Geralamon,
I will go... even into the castle!

78
00:08:24,140 --> 00:08:26,700
But how restless
this girl is!

79
00:08:30,060 --> 00:08:33,371
Speaking of the castle,
do you know about that noise?

80
00:08:33,420 --> 00:08:36,618
- What noise? - Every night,
a strange noise is heard...

81
00:08:36,660 --> 00:08:38,413
..in the stone well.

82
00:08:38,460 --> 00:08:40,975
They say it's the ghost of the King
wandering around the castle!

83
00:08:41,020 --> 00:08:43,376
- My father's ghost?!
- My God!

84
00:08:44,260 --> 00:08:46,729
Yes, but Geralamon
has anyone put in prison..

85
00:08:46,781 --> 00:08:50,091
...whoever says they have seen
the ghost, or talks about him.

86
00:08:50,341 --> 00:08:53,890
Then I'm going to the stone
well, so I'll know something too.

87
00:09:17,941 --> 00:09:20,455
This must be the
entrance to the stone well.

88
00:09:20,501 --> 00:09:22,890
The guard seems
rather thorough.

89
00:09:27,701 --> 00:09:30,261
Open up!

90
00:09:32,621 --> 00:09:34,339
This is the moment!

91
00:09:34,381 --> 00:09:37,020
Close it!

92
00:09:38,461 --> 00:09:41,214
The ghost knight!
Close it, quick! Close it!

93
00:09:45,141 --> 00:09:47,575
Excuse me, but I'm going through anyway!

94
00:09:52,101 --> 00:09:54,296
Damn, it's breaking!

95
00:10:23,221 --> 00:10:26,372
Damn you!
Work harder! Work, quickly!

96
00:10:35,581 --> 00:10:39,540
Come on, push!
Help me push!

97
00:10:42,261 --> 00:10:45,298
Water! Water!

98
00:10:45,501 --> 00:10:47,412
I want to drink!

99
00:10:49,741 --> 00:10:51,811
I'm so thirsty!

100
00:10:51,861 --> 00:10:55,570
If the Ghost Knight
appeared at the stone well...

101
00:10:55,621 --> 00:10:58,613
- Ah, Ghost Knight!
- Don't joke around!

102
00:10:58,661 --> 00:11:02,017
The Ghost Knight
doesn't really exist!

103
00:11:02,421 --> 00:11:04,696
It's a children's dream!

104
00:11:04,741 --> 00:11:08,620
If it goes on like this,
we will die of thirst!

105
00:11:13,181 --> 00:11:17,459
Water?! No, it's impossible!
Reality is something else!

106
00:11:17,781 --> 00:11:21,330
Then this must
surely be an illusion!

107
00:11:24,621 --> 00:11:26,896
Who poured
water on my face?

108
00:11:26,941 --> 00:11:28,852
There's water?!

109
00:11:31,541 --> 00:11:34,499
- Water! Water!
- Water!

110
00:11:34,541 --> 00:11:37,009
This really is water!

111
00:11:37,581 --> 00:11:40,493
How dare you
take some water?

112
00:11:45,821 --> 00:11:47,573
Ehi, you!

113
00:11:48,501 --> 00:11:50,412
Don't tyrannize the weak!

114
00:11:50,461 --> 00:11:53,055
But this is the voice
of the Ghost Knight!

115
00:11:53,101 --> 00:11:56,138
Where are you? Show yourself!

116
00:11:57,621 --> 00:11:59,259
Where are you?

117
00:12:01,021 --> 00:12:03,296
The Ghost Knight!

118
00:12:04,941 --> 00:12:07,614
Get him! Quick!

119
00:12:11,741 --> 00:12:13,572
Grab him!

120
00:12:26,421 --> 00:12:28,252
Come on, let's get him!

121
00:12:41,021 --> 00:12:42,739
Hup!

122
00:12:49,101 --> 00:12:52,377
- Please, don't hurt us!
- All right! Take the chains off everyone!

123
00:12:52,701 --> 00:12:54,419
Yes, sir!

124
00:12:56,621 --> 00:12:58,930
Uranaru! Garigori! Balia!

125
00:12:58,981 --> 00:13:01,336
But how does he know our names?

126
00:13:11,221 --> 00:13:12,620
Be quiet!

127
00:13:12,661 --> 00:13:15,414
Prince!... Oh, no! King Sapphire!
I'm so happy...

128
00:13:15,461 --> 00:13:18,851
...that you are safe!
- I have to take care of something

129
00:13:19,181 --> 00:13:21,741
I want to know about the ghost
of my father.

130
00:13:22,021 --> 00:13:24,615
I know the details,
because everyone...

131
00:13:24,661 --> 00:13:27,892
...who, in some way,
has heard of him...

132
00:13:27,941 --> 00:13:30,011
..has been brought here

133
00:13:30,461 --> 00:13:32,611
Someone heard his footsteps.

134
00:13:32,661 --> 00:13:35,539
- Has no one seen him?
- No, no one.

135
00:13:35,581 --> 00:13:38,049
It is said that every night,
at midnight,

136
00:13:38,101 --> 00:13:40,376
the voice
and the footsteps of the King...

137
00:13:40,421 --> 00:13:42,537
..are heard coming from the dungeons.

138
00:13:42,581 --> 00:13:44,651
From the dungeons?

139
00:13:52,101 --> 00:13:56,140
It must be almost midnight.
I'm getting the shivers!

140
00:14:00,381 --> 00:14:03,771
- Hey, it'll start in a bit!
- Shut up!

141
00:14:17,021 --> 00:14:20,616
"The third stone
under the lion decoration".

142
00:14:20,741 --> 00:14:24,131
One, two, three...
This is it!

143
00:14:53,701 --> 00:14:55,896
But this is a huge crypt!

144
00:15:03,901 --> 00:15:05,778
It's midnight.

145
00:15:22,101 --> 00:15:24,012
My father's voice!

146
00:15:57,741 --> 00:15:59,413
There he is!

147
00:16:01,741 --> 00:16:03,413
Father!

148
00:16:05,621 --> 00:16:08,055
- My father!
- Who's there?

149
00:16:09,541 --> 00:16:12,009
Father, you are alive! Father!

150
00:16:12,501 --> 00:16:14,731
But you are Sapphire!

151
00:16:15,741 --> 00:16:19,097
- My father!
- You're alive too.

152
00:16:20,701 --> 00:16:24,489
- Father, mother is doing well too!
- Really?

153
00:16:24,901 --> 00:16:27,540
But how did you end up here?

154
00:16:31,261 --> 00:16:33,900
Who the hell confined you
to this place?

155
00:16:33,941 --> 00:16:37,616
I don't know.
I couldn't see them.

156
00:16:37,741 --> 00:16:40,813
That night,
that is, when I was kidnapped,

157
00:16:41,141 --> 00:16:44,895
I was in my room and I was
writing an important proclamation..

158
00:17:02,661 --> 00:17:06,290
...when they kidnapped me
and brought me to these dungeons,

159
00:17:06,421 --> 00:17:10,460
where I was locked up
without enough food and water.

160
00:17:12,501 --> 00:17:16,289
The enemy wanted you to
die of hunger. That's it, isn't it?

161
00:17:16,341 --> 00:17:19,458
- Yes. There is something more important.
- What?

162
00:17:19,501 --> 00:17:21,696
I would really
like us to find...

163
00:17:21,741 --> 00:17:23,891
...that proclamation I
was writing that night.

164
00:17:23,941 --> 00:17:26,250
- It was burned, wasn't it?
- Yes.

165
00:17:26,501 --> 00:17:29,891
But I wrote it on leather, so
it must have remained intact.

166
00:17:29,941 --> 00:17:32,011
Sapphire, could you find it?

167
00:17:57,661 --> 00:17:59,492
The phantom knight!

168
00:18:04,421 --> 00:18:07,458
What? The phantom knight?

169
00:18:07,501 --> 00:18:10,493
You are still sleeping... The
guard is too vigilant and alert...

170
00:18:10,541 --> 00:18:13,339
...to allow him
to enter. Stupid!

171
00:18:37,661 --> 00:18:39,891
Here it is! I found it!

172
00:18:39,941 --> 00:18:41,897
It ended up in a strange place

173
00:18:42,141 --> 00:18:44,018
It's too dark to read it

174
00:18:44,421 --> 00:18:46,412
- Hey!
- I'm sorry, sir.

175
00:18:46,461 --> 00:18:49,100
- Give me the torch!
- Yes, sir!

176
00:18:50,421 --> 00:18:53,174
"King's Proclamation".
Now I can read it!

177
00:18:53,221 --> 00:18:55,018
Thank you very much!

178
00:18:55,301 --> 00:18:57,019
You're welcome, sir.

179
00:19:17,781 --> 00:19:19,578
Damn!

180
00:19:20,301 --> 00:19:23,020
Well, look at that...
Read this!

181
00:19:29,901 --> 00:19:33,894
This proclamation has been posted
on all the city walls!

182
00:19:33,941 --> 00:19:37,411
"Today, at ten, everyone gather
in front of the castle gate!

183
00:19:37,461 --> 00:19:40,100
- The Phantom Knight".
- What should we do? Shall we go?

184
00:19:40,141 --> 00:19:42,701
Of course! Maybe we'll get to see
something interesting.

185
00:19:46,621 --> 00:19:48,213
Drive them away!

186
00:19:48,261 --> 00:19:50,821
Use arrows, cannons
whatever you want, but drive them away!

187
00:19:50,861 --> 00:19:53,011
But there are too many of them
to drive them away!

188
00:19:53,141 --> 00:19:55,609
Damn him! What does he want to do?

189
00:20:25,301 --> 00:20:29,135
Attention!
I want you all to see a man!

190
00:20:29,701 --> 00:20:32,738
Geralamon! Neelon!
Look at him closely!

191
00:20:39,381 --> 00:20:42,418
But it's the Queen! How did she escape
from the coffin tower?!

192
00:20:49,061 --> 00:20:51,017
The King! It's impossible!

193
00:20:57,021 --> 00:20:59,012
How wonderful!

194
00:21:02,221 --> 00:21:04,018
Long live the King!

195
00:21:04,901 --> 00:21:09,099
- Hooray! Hooray!
- Long live the King!

196
00:21:09,141 --> 00:21:11,336
I was confined
in the dungeons...

197
00:21:11,381 --> 00:21:13,178
...and I was about to be killed.

198
00:21:13,221 --> 00:21:16,418
I'm sorry, but I don't know who
the criminal who wanted to kill me is.

199
00:21:16,461 --> 00:21:20,579
Thanks to the phantom knight,
I was saved and did not die!

200
00:21:20,621 --> 00:21:23,260
- Hooray for the phantom knight!
- Hooray!

201
00:21:31,341 --> 00:21:33,411
Now, father, let's go to the castle!

202
00:21:34,581 --> 00:21:37,732
I will not let you enter!
You are no longer the King!

203
00:21:37,781 --> 00:21:40,534
- Now Plastic is the King!
- Shut up, Geralamon!

204
00:21:40,581 --> 00:21:43,414
This castle belongs to me
and to my heir Sapphire!

205
00:21:43,461 --> 00:21:46,021
Heir?!
No, she is not the heir!

206
00:21:46,061 --> 00:21:49,417
According to our law, a woman
cannot succeed to the throne!

207
00:21:49,461 --> 00:21:52,134
This was true
until I modified the law!

208
00:21:52,181 --> 00:21:55,617
Modified the law?!
Can you show any proof?

209
00:21:55,661 --> 00:21:57,174
The proof is here!

210
00:21:57,221 --> 00:21:59,781
This is the authentic law,
bearing the King's seal!

211
00:21:59,821 --> 00:22:02,289
Before being imprisoned,
I wrote and sealed it!

212
00:22:02,341 --> 00:22:04,013
Damn it!

213
00:22:04,061 --> 00:22:07,497
And now I will announce before
all the people my proclamation!

214
00:22:07,701 --> 00:22:09,612
"This I declare as King:

215
00:22:09,661 --> 00:22:12,653
I modify the original law,
which established that a woman...

216
00:22:12,701 --> 00:22:15,340
..could not succeed
to the throne of Silverland.

217
00:22:15,381 --> 00:22:18,930
Now a woman can be Queen
and rule the country"!

218
00:22:19,181 --> 00:22:20,899
Mother!

219
00:22:24,021 --> 00:22:27,650
Listen, dad... so I
am no longer King, now...

220
00:22:27,901 --> 00:22:30,256
No, you're not! You bore!

221
00:22:30,301 --> 00:22:32,417
But is it really true?
I'm no longer King?

222
00:22:32,461 --> 00:22:34,292
Shut up, idiot!

223
00:22:34,341 --> 00:22:37,856
Good! Good!
How wonderful! Oh, how wonderful!

224
00:22:41,581 --> 00:22:43,890
And now let's go to the castle!

225
00:22:44,061 --> 00:22:47,292
- Hooray!
- Great!

226
00:22:49,821 --> 00:22:53,257
Damn it! Do you think
I will resign myself and surrender?

227
00:22:56,221 --> 00:22:58,781
Princess! Princess Sapphire!

228
00:22:58,941 --> 00:23:01,694
It's strange that you wear
boy's clothes.

229
00:23:03,141 --> 00:23:05,336
It's true. Thank you, maiden

230
00:23:07,301 --> 00:23:10,611
Thank you so much! But I still want to
wear boy's clothes.

231
00:23:10,661 --> 00:23:14,097
I will do so until in this country
there are no more tyrants.

232
00:23:14,181 --> 00:23:18,174
But I promise you that, when
peace finally arrives,

233
00:23:18,221 --> 00:23:20,940
this dress will be
the first one I'll wear!

234
00:24:06,620 --> 00:24:10,240
♪ Tarari Ratta Ritta Ratta Rattattaa ♪
-

235
00:24:10,241 --> 00:24:13,601
♪ Kyahoo! Kyahoo! Kyahoo! ♪
Yahoo! Yahoo! Yahoo!

236
00:24:13,602 --> 00:24:17,372
♪ Tarari Ratta Ritta Ratta Rattattaa ♪
-

237
00:24:17,373 --> 00:24:20,534
♪ Kyahoo! Kyahoo! Kyahoo! ♪
Yahoo! Yahoo! Yahoo!

238
00:24:20,535 --> 00:24:24,348
♪ Sen'nen man'nen hyakuman-nen ♪
A thousand years, ten thousand years, a million years,

239
00:24:24,349 --> 00:24:27,645
♪ Ribbon de tsunagou ichioku-nen ♪
Let’s connect with ribbons for a billion years!

240
00:24:27,646 --> 00:24:31,651
♪ Akuma ga kute mo arashi ga kute mo ♪
Even if devils come, even if storms arrive,

241
00:24:31,652 --> 00:24:35,090
♪ tsunaida kokoro wa hanarenai ♪
Our bonded hearts will never part.

